<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>دعوة البوت — Kratos System</title>
<meta name="description" content="إضافة بوت كراتوس إلى سيرفراتك — قيد التطوير. تابعنا على ديسكورد ليصلك إشعار فور إطلاقها.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#090713">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">

<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="دعوة البوت — Kratos System">
<meta property="og:description" content="إضافة بوت كراتوس إلى سيرفراتك — قيد التطوير. تابعنا على ديسكورد ليصلك إشعار فور إطلاقها.">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Kratos System">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://kratos-botdashboard.onrender.com/invite">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Tajawal:wght@400;500;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">

<!-- landing.css first, for the header, the buttons, the wave and the footer.
     under-dev.css is shared with /premium: the two pages differ only in the
     card's middle block, notes here, a roadmap there. -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/landing.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/under-dev.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/landing-head') %>

<!-- ══ Invite ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Sibling of /premium: same shape, same site furniture, same glass card, and
     still saying the feature is not ready. What it used to be is worth naming
     because it is the third time this has happened on this site — its own
     near-black, its own indigo (#6366f1 / #8b5cf6) that exists nowhere else, a
     grid, two blurred orbs, a floating 520px card with 18px corners, and an
     inline style block in the template.

     Two defects went with the styling. It loaded /css/style.css, the dashboard
     stylesheet, on a page that has no dashboard in it. And it wrapped a Font
     Awesome icon in another icon element, which is invalid nesting that only
     worked by accident. -->
<section class="ud-page">
  <canvas class="nx-sky" id="nxSky" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

  <div class="ud-head">
    <span class="ud-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="nx-wrap">
      <div class="ud-head__inner">
        <span class="ud-pill"><i class="fas fa-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> قيد التطوير — Under Development</span>
        <h1>إضافة البوت <em>قريباً</em></h1>
        <p>خاصية إضافة البوت إلى سيرفراتك في مرحلة التطوير. نشتغل عليها عشان نوصلك بأفضل تجربة.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ud-in">
    <div class="nx-wrap">
      <div class="ud-card">
        <div class="ud-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-code-branch"></i></div>
        <p class="ud-title">ما وصلتني بعد</p>
        <p class="ud-sub">الخطوات الثلاث، بالترتيب الي تشتغل عليها <strong>هسة</strong>.</p>

        <div class="ud-road">
          <div class="ud-road__item ud-road__item--done">
            <span class="ud-road__ico" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></span>
            <span>واجهة اختيار السيرفرات</span>
            <strong class="ud-road__state">تم</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="ud-road__item ud-road__item--active">
            <span class="ud-road__ico" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-gear"></i></span>
            <span>نظام الصلاحيات والأذونات</span>
            <strong class="ud-road__state">قيد العمل</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="ud-road__item ud-road__item--todo">
            <span class="ud-road__ico" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-clock"></i></span>
            <span>الإعداد المبدئي والتوجيه</span>
            <strong class="ud-road__state">قريباً</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ud-bar">
          <div class="ud-bar__track" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <span class="ud-bar__text">قيد التطوير — Under Development</span>
        </div>

        <div class="ud-acts">
          <a href="https://discord.gg/fadix9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="nx-btn nx-btn-d"><i class="fab fa-discord"></i> تواصل معنا عبر الديسكورد</a>
          <% if (locals.user) { %>
          <a href="/home" class="nx-btn nx-btn-p"><i class="fas fa-gauge-high nx-sico"></i> لوحة التحكم</a>
          <% } %>
          <a href="/" class="nx-btn nx-btn-o"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right nx-ico"></i> العودة للصفحة الرئيسية</a>
        </div>

        <p class="ud-foot">Kratos System &copy; 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/landing-foot') %>

<%- include('partials/landing-script') %>
</body>
</html>